  doc=buildPayouts converts positive net deltas into on-chain payouts (USDL owed to\nthe mapped EVM recipient). Zero/negative deltas carry no on-chain payout.\nPayouts are sorted by recipient for deterministic calldata. An unmapped or\ninvalid EVM address on a positive delta is a hard error (we never pay a\nzero/garbage address).
EDGES
  ^defines=github.com/paxlabs-inc/layerx/internal/chain/settler.go

